BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Tech Events
UID:event_314332957@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260518T042510Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260528T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260528T190000
SUMMARY:Code with Asheville Monthly Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Tech Events\nAre you curious or even passionate abou
 t using advocacy\, technology and sensible design to create more equitable
  social and civic structures in Western North Carolina?\n\nWhether you cal
 l yourself an organizer\, a technologist\, a designer\, planner\, concerne
 d resident\, all of the above or something else entirely\, we want to be i
 n relationship and build community together with you.\nCheck out a list of
  our current projects: [https://github.com/CodeForAsheville/projects](http
 s://github.com/CodeForAsheville/projects)\n\nWhat to expect:\nSince projec
 t work takes place asynchronously—individually and in smaller squads—t
 he goals of our monthly gatherings are to:\n\n* build relationships and le
 arn about each other's skills\, interests and goals\,\n* learn what we are
  doing across the organization (project updates)\,\n* provide opportunitie
 s to get involved with and/or initiate projects\, and\n* shape where we ar
 e going as an organization\, co-creating the culture and course of our wor
 k together.\n\nIn this meeting\, we will:\n\n* gather virtually using Goog
 le Meet for group video chat\,\n* do brief introductions\, with a prompt\,
 \n* share updates about the projects that we're working on\, highlighting 
 deliverables for the next month and areas where additional resources would
  be useful\, and\n* discuss proposals and new opportunities to engage with
  local government and community organizations.\n\nIt isn't all glamorous\,
  but the stakes are low for showing up and we'd be delighted to join toget
 her with you in this work.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avltech/events/314332957/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260417T133821Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260417T133821Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
