X-SOURCE:Asheville Tech Events
UID:event_314650727@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260518T042510Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260607T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260607T163000
SUMMARY:Asheville Data Professionals
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Tech Events\nCalling all Data Analysts\, Data Engine
 ers\, Data Scientists\, Data Quality Specialists\, and anyone else who wor
 ks with data to hang out\, grab a drink\, and talk shop.\n\nFor this Meetu
 p\, we'll be at Hi-Wire's RAD Beer Garden. This will be a casual event to 
 meet other people working with data.\n\nIf you're looking to give a presen
 tation\, let us know\, and we'll help set it up. We also take suggestions 
 for alternate Meetup styles\, locations\, or times.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avltech/events/314650727/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260505T232946Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260505T232946Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
